# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# L3 standby-conditional — a human standby operator, not approving every step
# (unlike L0) but on call for the specific footprints that carry financial,
# irreversible, or external-publish consequence: each is referred to the
# standby operator for sign-off before release (AI Act Art. 14(4)(d)+(e): the
# ability to override/reverse and to intervene/halt). Below L3 these three
# footprints are never auto-released at all (RVND: NO-GO below the standby
# grade); at and above L3 they clear only through this reservation, never
# through the grade comparison alone.
actor agent grade L3
human standby role standby-operator
gate  action risk high grade L3 grant agent
reserve agent-action by standby-operator when tags contains financial
reserve agent-action by standby-operator when tags contains irreversible
reserve agent-action by standby-operator when tags contains external-publish
cord  agent  -> action
cord  action -> master
